          "name": "get_scan",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:a32fadf59c6b9116cced03bf8b9780efd6743ec83d2363dc719c38af14f1b09a",
          "description": "Fetch the full result of one stored scan by its id, as it was returned when the document was recognised. Input: scan_id \\u2013 meta.id of a scan_document result, or id of a list_scans row. Output: the same Scan object scan_document returns (meta, document, holder, fields, mrz and the rest) plus a one-line summary, with two differences: the image crops are never stored, so every images slot is null, and quality reads not_checked. Calls GET /v1/scans/{id}; it never re-runs recognition and never charges a credit. ",
