          "canonical_hash": "sha256:dcc41e41ebfd22c7e81fda7fe3e0260a7e1774a45ed57726908ee84aade7a7c7",
          "description": "Full-text search over the doc.cheap API documentation \\u2013 endpoints, request options, every response field, the error codes and what to do about each, MRZ rules, retention and pricing. Takes a query and an optional limit (1 to 20, default 5), and answers with the matching sections: title, a snippet, and a link to the page. It reads a copy of the documentation shipped beside this server, so it makes no network call and works offline. Use it before guessing at a field name, an error code or a scan option \\u2013 what it returns is the published contract rather than a recollection of it.",
